==French==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|fr|frm|moins}}, from {{inh|fr|fro|meins}}, from {{inh|fr|la|minus}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/mwɛ̃/|lang=fr}}
* {{IPA|[mwæ̃]|lang=fr}}

===Adverb===
{{fr-adv}}

# [[less]]
#: {{ux|fr|Faites '''moins''' de bruit.|Make less noise.}}
#: {{ux|fr|J'ai '''moins''' de thé que toi.|I have '''less''' tea than you.}}
#: {{ux|fr|J'ai '''moins''' de thé que de café.|I have '''less''' tea than coffee.}}
#: {{ux|fr|J'ai dû attendre '''moins''' de dix minutes.|I had to wait '''less''' than ten minutes.}}
# {{lb|fr|with numbers}} [[minus]]; [[negative]]
#: {{ux|fr|'''moins''' cinq|minus five}}
# {{lb|fr|preceded by a [[definite article]]}} the [[least]]
#: {{ux|fr|C'est lui qui gagne le '''moins''' (d'argent) dans sa famille.|He earns the least money in his family.}}
#: {{ux|fr|C'était la chose la '''moins''' surprenante.|It was the least surprising thing.}}

====Antonyms====
* {{l|fr|plus}}

====Derived terms====
* {{l|fr|à moins que}}
* {{l|fr|au moins}}

===Noun===
{{fr-noun|m|moins}}

# the [[minus]] sign

===Preposition===
{{fr-prep}}

# [[minus]]
#: {{ux|fr|Cinq '''moins''' deux font trois|Five minus two makes three.}}

====Antonyms====
* {{l|fr|plus}}

